		{
			description: ["&6Kaleidoscope Cookery&r is the pack's cooking mod. Woks, stockpots and steamers all need a lit heat source under them.", "", "Craft a &eStove&r (a campfire surrounded by 8 cobblestone), place it and light it with &eFlint and Steel&r. Put your cookware on top."]
