		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3132DB5B5770DA53"]
			description: ["&e1.&r Put a &eWok&r on your lit stove.", "&e2.&r Add &eOil&r. Get oil by defeating pigs, piglins or hoglins with a &eKitchen Knife&r, or by grinding seeds in a &eMillstone&r (a harnessed animal turns it).", "&e3.&r Add the ingredients, then &eright-click with a Kitchen Shovel&r to stir-fry until it's done.", "&e4.&r Serve it into a &eBowl&r. Wrong ingredients or waiting too long burns it!", "", "Try it: &e3 eggs + 3 tomatoes&r, stir 3 times = &6Scramble Egg with Tomatoes&r. (Tomato seeds: see the Straw Hat tip next.)"]
			icon: "kaleidoscope_cookery:pot"
			id: "9BE5A20AA59DCC67"
			rewards: [
