		{
			dependencies: ["9BE5A20AA59DCC67"]
			description: ["&6Chopping Board:&r place meat or fish on it and hit it with a &eKitchen Knife&r to cut it into ingredients.", "&6Straw Hat:&r wear it while breaking grass to find &etomato, chili, lettuce and rice&r seeds. Rice grows in flooded farmland.", "&6Steamer:&r stack up to &e8&r on one heat source, then &esneak + right-click&r to start steaming.", "&6Blank Recipe (4 paper):&r right-click a wok or stockpot full of ingredients to record them. Next time, right-click with the recipe to add everything from your inventory in one go."]
