		{
			description: ["&6Spice of Life: Carrot Edition&r rewards a varied diet. Every time you eat enough &enew&r foods you hit a milestone and gain &cextra hearts&r for good.", "", "Craft a &eFood Book&r to see what you've tasted, what you haven't, and how far the next heart is. Kaleidoscope dishes count, so cook a lot!"]
