			description: ["Place a &6Small Ship&r (start with a Cog) on water and &eright-click&r to board.", "", "Ships have their own keys under &eOptions → Controls → Small Ships&r: &eToggle Sail&r, &eHigher / Lower Sail&r for speed, and &eOpen Ship Inventory&r for cargo. War galleys carry &eShip Cannons&r that fire Cannon Balls.", "", "Bring friends: ships carry several passengers."]
